{"id":"n61076-8-6","stage":1,"title":"깨끗이 · 正正当当","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61076-8-6-1","ko":"나와 정정당당하게 싸우자.","zh":"我们光明正大地打一架吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나와","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；와：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정정당당하게","meaning":"堂堂正正","explanation":"정정당당하다：堂堂正正；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"정정당당하다","audio":"/audio/26c03818dd26e8fa2293.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75904","senseId":"1","lemma":"정정당당하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"싸우자.","meaning":"打架，争斗","explanation":"싸우다：打架，争斗；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"싸우다","audio":"/audio/e27f0e273d4af17d7ed1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29732","senseId":"1","lemma":"싸우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"26c03818dd26e8fa","term":"정정당당하다","zh":"堂堂正正","audio":"/audio/26c03818dd26e8fa2293.mp3","entryId":"75904","definition":"态度、手段正当且光明正大。","pronunciation":["정ː정당당하다"]},{"id":"e27f0e273d4af17d","term":"싸우다","zh":"打架，争斗","audio":"/audio/e27f0e273d4af17d7ed1.mp3","entryId":"29732","definition":"想要获胜而用语言或力气等进行较量。","pronunciation":["싸우다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c662a9642654438a8c62.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n61076-8-6-2","ko":"좋아. 한번 깨끗이 붙어 보자고!","zh":"好啊，那就来场痛快对决吧！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"좋아.","meaning":"行，可以","explanation":"좋다：行，可以；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"12","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한번","meaning":"一下","explanation":"한번：一下","readings":[{"term":"한번","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57336","senseId":"2","lemma":"한번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"깨끗이","meaning":"正正当当，公平地，清廉地","explanation":"깨끗이：正正当当，公平地，清廉地","readings":[{"term":"깨끗이","audio":"/audio/356f24a2b3817821ba78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61076","senseId":"8","lemma":"깨끗이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"붙어","meaning":"发生，爆发","explanation":"붙다：发生，爆发；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"붙다","audio":"/audio/25c69080a9810c70a4d0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74181","senseId":"21","lemma":"붙다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보자고!","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；자고：重申一起行动的提议，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"行，可以","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"某个行动或事情等不成问题。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"54e30ff4210956a6","term":"한번","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3","entryId":"57336","definition":"表示把某事当做试验来尝试。","pronunciation":["한번"]},{"id":"356f24a2b3817821","term":"깨끗이","zh":"正正当当，公平地，清廉地","audio":"/audio/356f24a2b3817821ba78.mp3","entryId":"61076","definition":"心地或行为光明磊落、端正明确地。","pronunciation":["깨끄시"]},{"id":"25c69080a9810c70","term":"붙다","zh":"发生，爆发","audio":"/audio/25c69080a9810c70a4d0.mp3","entryId":"74181","definition":"产生较量或争斗等。","pronunciation":["붇따"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/94eb98e45683da384e92.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.036,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=61076","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourc